e('`hmac.compare_digest` compares in constant time, so response timing doesn\'t reveal how many bytes matched.','`hmac.compare_digest` avoids content-dependent early exit for same-type, same-length inputs. It does not make the whole login constant-time; type or length differences and other code can still affect timing.','CPythondocsqualification.',[h])
